    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "common_0060_mama_06",
      "hash64": "3C548BFF337DA337",
      "text": "It’s a brand-new phone!\\c\\nAccording to the instructions, you can check the\\nmap app by pressing the [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Y Button[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].\\c\\nIt’ll help keep you from getting lost, so take\\ngood care of your new gadget, OK?[VAR 0x0114(002B)]",
